# raw v1 integrity baseline — sha256 of the six store files, `shasum -c` format.
# Taken 2026-08-06 (Phase 5a.1, PROMPT-5a1 F6) BEFORE the 5a.1 discovery scan: this is
# the post-5a state of data/raw/posts|comments. `data/` is gitignored, so `git status`
# is silent about these files in both directions and proves nothing; this record is the
# only durable way to re-run the check. 5a took the same measurement into a scratchpad
# that did not survive the session — acceptance has to be able to repeat it.
#
#     shasum -c results/raw_v1_baseline.sha256
#
# A line that fails here means a store SPEC 3.11 (4) and PROMPT-5a1 both call read-only
# was written to. The derived sidecar data/raw/post_polls.jsonl is NOT baselined here:
# it is 5a output beside the store, and its own sha256 lives in results/poll_census_5a.json.
